        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n  autonumber\n  actor C as Citizen\n  participant UI as Waste Management Portal\n  participant AUTH as Authentication Service\n  participant WM as Waste Management Service\n  participant ML as Computer Vision / ML\n  participant SCH as Scheduling Service\n  actor OFF as Municipal Officer\n  actor SUP as Supervisor\n  participant GPS as GPS Tracking Service\n  actor DR as Driver\n  actor WK as Waste Worker\n  participant NOTIF as Notification Service\n  database DB as Waste Database\n\n  C-&gt;&gt;UI: Submit waste report\n  UI-&gt;&gt;AUTH: Validate session\n  AUTH--&gt;&gt;UI: Authentication result\n  UI-&gt;&gt;WM: Create waste report\n  WM-&gt;&gt;ML: Classify waste image\n  ML--&gt;&gt;WM: Category + confidence\n  WM-&gt;&gt;DB: Store report and bin status\n  WM-&gt;&gt;ML: Predict collection demand\n  ML--&gt;&gt;WM: Priority prediction\n  WM-&gt;&gt;SCH: Generate collection schedule\n  SCH-&gt;&gt;OFF: Request schedule review\n  OFF-&gt;&gt;SUP: Request approval\n  SUP--&gt;&gt;OFF: Approve schedule\n  OFF-&gt;&gt;SCH: Confirm schedule\n  SCH-&gt;&gt;WM: Assign vehicle and workers\n  WM-&gt;&gt;DR: Send route\n  WM-&gt;&gt;WK: Send assignment\n  DR-&gt;&gt;GPS: Start route / send location\n  GPS--&gt;&gt;WM: Live GPS location\n  DR-&gt;&gt;WM: Collection started\n  WK-&gt;&gt;WM: Waste collected\n  WM-&gt;&gt;DB: Update collection status\n  WM-&gt;&gt;NOTIF: Trigger notification\n  NOTIF--&gt;&gt;C: Collection completed\n  C-&gt;&gt;UI: Submit complaint if needed\n  UI-&gt;&gt;WM: Create complaint\n  WM-&gt;&gt;OFF: Assign complaint\n  OFF-&gt;&gt;WM: Resolve complaint\n  WM-&gt;&gt;DB: Record complaint and audit log&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="2">
